# Copy to cache.env (git-ignored) and set the shared build cache location for
# this build box. The Makefile loads cache.env via `-include`.
#
# The cross-compile SDK, the RKNN toolkit clone, and the compiled models live in
# this cache, OUTSIDE the repo, and are SHARED with the other BrightSign NPU
# extensions (e.g. brightsign-voice-llm-extension) so one cobra-toolchain SDK
# serves them all. Set an ABSOLUTE path; a relative value resolves against the
# repo root. Default (if unset): ../argus-build-cache (parallel to this checkout).
#
# Example:
# BS_CACHE_DIR := /home/you/src/brightsign-playground/argus-all/argus-build-cache
